              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kiilimok Parao yes ebe, ‘Kitodikinai nakaumokin’: ŋes konyet ilimokinia Aaron ebe, “Koyana ebelakon, kocakak akonyen nuka Parao, tetere eraun emun.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.9",
