        {
          "text": " Ilimokini ŋes ebe, ‘EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Iburanian, ŋes keyakunit mama ijai, ebe, “Kisiik ikatuŋa alosit, tetere kejaanakinete eoŋ kamodiŋ: ido koany, aitodol lolo mam ipupunit.” ",
