        {
          "text": " Kobala EJAKAIT Musa ebe, “Kolimok Aaron ebe, “Koyana ebelakon, korio akonikan akipi nuka Misiri, ocorinikec, ka alelesiakec, ka ataparinikec, ka abwalinikec kere nuka akipi, koluoros aokot; ejaunos aokot akwap kere nako Misiri, toma oborokec luka akito ka amotiikec nuka amor.’’’",
