              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiswamata kwaŋin imurwok luka Misiri kotoma acoakec nakaiyeiyea; kogogoŋior etau loka Parao komam iirari kes; kwape abalar EJAKAIT. ",
